<title>HONG KONG: Shun Tak posts 1996 net HK$421.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Shun Tak posts 1996 net HK$421.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   28.7     vs     49.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    22.5     vs     22.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs     16.0 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    421.5    vs    718.5</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,603.8  vs  1,768.2</p>
<p>    Company name		 Shun Tak Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 May 6-9</p>
<p>    Dividend payout	   To be announced</p>
<p>NOTE - Shun Tak is an investment holding, property, shipping, shipbuilding and finance company.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 32.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 10 cents) vs 32.5 cents.</p>
<p>Earnings per share is calculated using the weighted average of 1,466,616,081 shares in issue during the period under review, compared with 1,461,047,507 shares in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
